# This file intentionally holds no pnpm settings.
#
# pnpm 10 moved project settings to `pnpm-workspace.yaml`, and pnpm 11 confirmed it: `pnpm config get
# node-linker` answers `undefined` no matter what is written here. Two settings lived in this file for
# a long time and had stopped doing anything —
#
#   node-linker=hoisted
#   confirm-modules-purge=false
#
# — which is why the hoisted layout survived only through `node_modules/.modules.yaml` from an older
# install, and why a plain `pnpm test` could suddenly abort with
# ERR_PNPM_ABORTED_REMOVE_MODULES_DIR_NO_TTY. Both now live in `pnpm-workspace.yaml`, spelled the way
# that file spells them, where they are actually read.
#
# Keep registry or auth settings here if they are ever needed; pnpm does still read those.
